WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.600
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.500
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:58.870
The king... King Lief is missing!

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.500
So Lief isn't in the palace, correct?

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:05.100
We have looked all over the palace, but...

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:09.900
In fact, we couldn't find
Mr Barda or Ms Jasmine either.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:13.200
Those two really can't help themselves...

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:16.300
They couldn't have gotten far.

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:19.600
If you can catch up to them, I'd like
you to ask that they return.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:24.200
Doom left just earlier to pursue them.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.700
Doom has...?

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.990
I do hope he can work things out.

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:00.200
This forest is a lot brighter now.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:03.310
Now we don't have to worry
about being ambushed by Wenn.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:08.530
The forest's trees are grateful to
Lief for banishing the Shadow Lord.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:12.500
Well, it's not like I did it all on my own.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:13.700
That's right.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:15.800
It's also thanks to me.

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:25.900
Although, the trees seem to be
troubled by the Wennbar lately.

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.200
The Wennbar?

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:28.210
Ah, that thing...

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:31.700
<i>Hey, over here!</i>

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:34.930
<i>Now, come!</i>

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:42.520
<i>Lief!</i>

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:48.480
<i>Barda!</i>

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:55.400
We still haven't killed that creature.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:59.000
If the forest is troubled by it,
then let's defeat it together!

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.000
Let's do it!

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.960
No, wait a minute, Jasmine.

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:07.200
I have an idea.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.700
What do you mean?

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.700
The Wennbar is a tough opponent.

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:14.500
It's not something we can
kill just by fighting it normally.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:15.700
That's true.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:20.600
I think Lief and I should set up
a trap to defeat the Wennbar.

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:22.480
Huh? Then what about me?

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:26.800
You can just stand by and relax
until we're done preparing it.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.200
What do you mean?!

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:31.300
Are you saying that Filli, Kree
and I would just get in the way?

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.200
I wouldn't go that far.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.100
Jasmine!

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:41.100
What's with him? What's with him?!

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.800
Whatever. Let's just go home!

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:51.100
Hey, Barda...

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:54.600
The way you said that to Jasmine.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.900
That was on purpose, wasn't it?

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:00.500
More or less.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.100
Jasmine is always working hard.

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:07.020
I thought I should let her
relax while she's at home.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:10.900
And she wouldn't just take a
break if she were told to, after all.

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.100
That's right.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:19.200
But, I hope we can defeat the
Wennbar with just the two of us.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:22.100
I don't want to put Jasmine in harm's way.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.600
Things have changed around here, too.

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:32.800
The trees are in high spirits now
that the Shadow Lord is gone.

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.700
It's so good to be back!

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.200
My home...

00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:00.570
To think that I'm able to see
the forest like this again.

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:05.500
It feels like it was only
yesterday when I left home.

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:07.500
Meeting Lief and Barda,

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.700
gathering the gems of Deltora...

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:13.800
I still can't believe that Lief
wound up being the heir.

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.300
Right?

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:20.200
Nobody was expecting that one.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:26.100
You're hungry, aren't you?

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:29.000
Let's get some delicious food from the forest!

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.200
Alright, I think this is enough for today.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:45.700
Yeah. The battle will begin tomorrow.

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:53.000
I think we'd best sleep up in the trees tonight.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.040
Yeah, we should.

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.100
Filli and Kree haven't changed one bit.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:14.150
Come here, you two.

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.900
I'm so glad to have you both with me.

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:40.300
Don't move.

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:47.400
Doom!

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:57.600
The night is when they thrive.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:00.200
I really wouldn't want to go down there.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:02.700
Come to think of it,

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:05.400
I wonder how Jasmine is doing right now.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:07.000
Are you worried about her?

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.500
Well I...

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.870
Yeah. I am worried.

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:19.800
We can apologise to her when
she comes back tomorrow.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.000
Yeah...

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.200
you're right.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:29.900
You three have caused quite a
ruckus in Del Palace by leaving.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:32.200
How did you know to come here?

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:35.600
This forest was originally <i>my</i> home.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:40.700
I guessed that the Forests of Silence would be
your first destination, so I rushed over here.

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:42.030
There's no need to worry.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:45.300
Lief and I aren't kids anymore.

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:47.800
We won't do anything to inconvenience you,

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:49.500
so you can relax and be on your way.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.600
I am your father!

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:53.500
There's no need for that attitude.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:57.300
If my attitude bothers you, then I'll apologise.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.420
Well, that's not what I meant...

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:06.400
Th-Then, what did you mean by that?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:12.800
Do you expect me to explain
how a father feels about this?

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:22.300
What?

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:24.700
Stop it!

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:30.600
Help me, Jasmine!

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:37.000
Hey, get off me!

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:38.800
You again?!

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:48.000
Filli, Kree, come here.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:54.600
How did you like Filli and Kree's assault?

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:59.000
It was quite intense. It appears you
have two loyal subordinates, Jasmine.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:06.100
While I was living here all alone,
the ones who cheered me up,

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:08.900
and kept me company here,

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:11.160
were Filli and Kree.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:14.600
I see.

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:51.100
<i>Jasmine!</i>

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:54.400
<i>Jasmine!!</i>

00:11:57.900 --> 00:11:58.900
Barda.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.500
Can't sleep?

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:02.300
Yeah...

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:06.610
I remembered when we met
Jasmine for the first time in this forest.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:10.500
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.700
<i>Hey Filli, this looks pretty good, don't you think?</i>

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:21.600
<i>The swords? I have so many of them already,
and it's not like you can use them, right?</i>

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:23.000
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:28.400
<i>See? It's fortunate that we took this path,</i>

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:31.220
after all, there probably won't be
anything left here by tomorrow.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.300
It's amazing how things turn out.

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:40.100
We met Jasmine in this forest,
and then travelled together.

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:41.300
Yeah.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:46.300
Had it been just you and I, I'm sure our
journey would have been far more difficult.

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:47.800
That's true.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:51.700
Lief, what do you think of Jasmine?

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:52.440
Huh?!

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.900
She's more than just a travelling partner, right?

00:12:58.300 --> 00:13:00.340
What are you talking about, Barda?!

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:04.200
It's fine. Never mind.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:06.700
What's the deal with you?

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.500
Well then, I'll be going back to the palace.

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:15.500
Yeah.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:19.110
If possible, I'd also like you
three to return to Del Palace soon.

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:26.300
Your face is saying "you have no
right to order me around".

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.200
No, that's not true...

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.200
It's fine.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:30.300
See you.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.500
I'm fine.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.360
You don't need to say anything.

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.400
It should be ready now.

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:44.500
Yeah.

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:47.100
Now we just have to lure the Wennbar here.

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:49.500
I can imagine that taking a while.

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:51.600
It will take no time at all.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:55.590
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:58.840
Come out, Wennbar!

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:02.300
Geez, so in the end, <i>we're</i> going to be the bait?

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:05.200
It can't be helped, seeing as Jasmine isn't here.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:07.300
I know...

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:10.000
Hey! Hey!

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:14.360
Come out, Wennbar!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.620
I'm glad I was able to come back home.

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:30.330
This is where we were born.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:34.400
But, this isn't where I should be right now.

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:41.800
That's right! I need to go back to Lief and Barda!

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:50.400
Very good! Just a bit further!

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:51.900
Don't get caught now!

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:53.300
You too!

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:13.300
Did we do it?

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:15.210
I think so...

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:23.470
Lief!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:33.000
Lief, this is bad!

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:35.000
That thing can stretch its neck!

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:41.570
Lief!

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:48.300
Lief!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:54.900
Jasmine!

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:07.200
So it got caught in the roots and
rocks and didn't fall all the way down...

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:12.600
Lief!

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:15.800
Barda!

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:18.400
Be careful, Jasmine!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.630
Jasmine!

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:42.630
Jasmine!

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:57.300
Doom!

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:58.800
You saved her.

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:02.100
Save the talk for later. Aim for the other eye.

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:22.130
Lief!

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:27.900
Doom, throw me towards the Wennbar!

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:35.200
It didn't go quite as planned, but it looks
like we've managed to defeat the Wennbar.

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:38.400
I think the trees of the forest helped too.

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:39.900
Could you tell?

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:43.850
The trees are happy that we freed them,

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:48.400
so they loosened their roots
to make the Wennbar slip.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.930
So she is trusted by the trees of the forest...

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:54.200
That time really was...

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:59.230
It seems like you three were right all along...

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:05.800
Sorry about this, Doom.

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:09.500
We promise we'll go back to Del Palace
after we're done travelling around Deltora.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.900
Please forgive our selfish request.

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:17.200
I know very well that I can't stop
you three from doing as you please.

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:24.600
Oh my, what's this all of a sudden?

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:31.300
They're thanking you for saving me.

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:34.300
And let me also...

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:40.400
Thanks for saving me.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.600
But, it was a pretty close call.

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:47.500
It's natural for a father to save his own daughter.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.900
You two are quite alike.

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:53.000
Stubborn, yet kind.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:55.600
There's no doubt that
you're father and daughter.

00:19:57.100 --> 00:19:59.000
What's with you two?!

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.370
I can't stay here for long.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:04.800
I need to be getting back to Del Palace.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:06.100
So this is goodbye, then.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:08.130
See you later, Doom.

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:21.800
Doom!

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:26.810
Thank you, Dad!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:28.700
See you soon!

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:31.700
Safe journey.

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:43.000
Is that so?

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:46.800
So this means that Lief and the
others won't be back for quite a while.

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:48.000
Yes.

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:54.900
But this might be a good learning experience
for Lief to help him rule this country.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.900
If I may say so, I feel the same way.

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:03.140
He also has Barda and Jasmine,
his irreplaceable friends, at his side.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:07.160
I can say that it's the same for Jasmine also.

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:15.100
Parents always worry about their children.

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:17.900
The same goes for the both of us, too.

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:21.410
You're right, Lady Sharn.

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:46.000
<i>Jasmine.</i>

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:49.800
<i>My beloved child.</i>

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:54.000
<i>I will always protect you, no matter what.</i>

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:57.900
<i>We will do anything for
the sake of your happiness.</i>

00:21:57.900 --> 00:22:01.700
<i>You are our most precious treasure.</i>

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:07.000
<i>Dad, Mum, thank you for everything!</i>

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:11.700
<i>I love you both so so so much!</i>

00:22:23.800 --> 00:22:25.500
<i>Thank you,</i>

00:22:25.500 --> 00:22:27.200
Dad...

00:22:36.240 --> 00:22:40.420
Bye-bye, thank you! The memories that we shared

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:45.500
are like a never-fading diamond

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:50.510
Non-stop, I'm not going to hit the brakes

00:22:50.510 --> 00:22:55.560
I have to continue making this album

00:22:56.220 --> 00:23:00.890
Three springtimes have passed since then

00:23:00.890 --> 00:23:05.270
but I still remember you

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:11.700
In this ever-changing city landscape

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:16.080
I'm going out today, wearing a new pair of shoes

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:20.120
in search of tomorrow

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:24.630
In this corner of the world

00:23:24.630 --> 00:23:30.380
it really is a miracle that we met each other

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:34.760
It's great to know that today and tomorrow

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:37.890
we will be seeing each other countless times

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:40.230
Thank you

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:44.810
Let's chase after our hopes and dreams

00:23:44.810 --> 00:23:50.650
and with a deep breath, say "good morning" to the sun

00:23:50.820 --> 00:23:56.200
Our hearts feel the time passing by, so hold me tight

00:23:56.200 --> 00:24:00.000
and we can start running towards our next adventure

00:24:05.900 --> 00:24:10.700
After defeating the Wennbar,
peace returned to the Forests of Silence.

00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:16.400
Our next destination is the city
where Manus and the Ralad tribe live.

00:24:16.700 --> 00:24:20.400
A fortune teller known for making
accurate predictions lives there,

00:24:20.400 --> 00:24:23.500
and he says that he will predict our futures.

00:24:23.500 --> 00:24:26.930
Be careful, Jasmine. He's planning something.

00:24:27.590 --> 00:24:30.000
Next time, 'Trap of the Underground Maze'.

00:24:28.770 --> 00:24:34.740
Trap of the Underground Maze

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:32.740
Is the fortune teller actually an Ol?

00:24:33.000 --> 00:24:34.730
Or could it be...

00:24:49.750 --> 00:24:54.800
See you next time
